Main Tasks And Responsibilities

Noesis is looking for professionals with the following profile:


Program, optimize, and maintain advanced code architectures utilizing Python, PySpark, and Databricks ecosystems;
Design and manage robust data and Machine Learning pipelines within Microsoft Azure, ensuring data governance and security;
Deploy and support productive GenAI applications, utilizing OpenAI APIs, RAG solutions, and agentic frameworks (LangChain, LangGraph, Langfuse);
Oversee database modeling, develop REST APIs, and implement DevOps practices using GitHub and automated testing (pytest, SonarQube).Y


Profile


Degree in Computer Science or similar;
Minimum of 3 years of experience working with Python in Data Engineering or AI environments;
Solid hands-on expertise in Databricks, Azure Data Factory, GenAI APIs, and vector databases;
Fluent English and Portuguese skills (written and spoken), with Spanish being highly valued;
Excellent communication and collaboration skills to operate effectively within global and multicultural teams;
Strong analytical and critical thinking mindset, focused on troubleshooting, code quality, and problem-solving.


If you meet these requirements and are interested in joining an audacious and innovative company, please send us your application.

Join us. Let’s innovate together!

All our recruitment and selection processes are based on equal opportunities, valuing the competence and potential of each person and ensuring that no candidate is discriminated on the grounds of gender, ethnicity, sexual orientation, age, religion or physical condition.


